# 🐼 Pandas – Beginner to Professional

This repository contains my **Python Pandas learning and practice programs**, starting from basic concepts and gradually moving toward more advanced data manipulation and analysis techniques.

## 📚 Topics Covered

* Introduction to Pandas
* Series and DataFrames
* Creating and accessing DataFrames
* Selecting rows and columns
* `.loc` and `.iloc`
* Adding and removing columns
* Handling missing values
* `isnull()` and `isna()`
* `fillna()`
* Forward Fill (`ffill`)
* Backward Fill (`bfill`)
* Interpolation
* Data type conversion
* `pd.to_numeric()`
* Sorting DataFrames
* Sorting by multiple columns
* Filtering data
* Descriptive / Summary Statistics
* Mean, Median, Mode
* Variance and Standard Deviation
* Data Cleaning
* Practical Data Analysis

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* Python
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Jupyter Notebook / VS Code

## 🎯 Purpose

The purpose of this repository is to build a strong foundation in **Pandas and data analysis** through practical examples and hands-on coding.

This repository documents my learning journey from **beginner concepts to professional-level data manipulation and analysis**.

